# With Port 2 wired back to Port 1 in scrambled order (the "random-number wiring"), a plain counter
# Start: 000 PC RUN.  MiSTer menu: Random-number wiring = On
# turns into a jumbled sequence: write the counter to Port 2, read it back from Port 1, show it.

000 ako 04.000
001 abs 06.020
002 lda 05.020
003 p2a 18.000
004 p1e 16.000
005 anz 02.000
006 vzg 03.250
007 lda 05.020
008 vgl 10.022
009 spb 11.000
010 add 07.021
011 abs 06.020
012 spu 09.002
021     00.001
022     00.255
